  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For a first order reaction, the time required for completion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mo>%</mo></math> reaction is &#39;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&#39; times the half life of the reaction. The value of &#39;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&#39; is</p><p>(Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3010</mn></math>)</p>"
  },
